[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16862.15, "timestamp": "04:41:02", "text": "嗯？你愿意为了……而做这件事吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16865.11, "timestamp": "04:41:05", "text": "比如人们在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16867.51, "timestamp": "04:41:07", "text": "嗯，我只是从来不谈论坏事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16870.99, "timestamp": "04:41:10", "text": "不再谈论他们了，但是呃，这是掩盖的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16875.15, "timestamp": "04:41:15", "text": "伤心。这就是互联网。笨蛋。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16879.59, "timestamp": "04:41:19", "text": "互联网。呃，我这么说并不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16883.39, "timestamp": "04:41:23", "text": "坏事。我的意思是，我是说那件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16887.868, "timestamp": "04:41:27", "text": "就我个人而言，我已经看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16891.27, "timestamp": "04:41:31", "text": "更糟的是，我认为即使在我内部也是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16895.35, "timestamp": "04:41:35", "text": "我所在的社区里，我见过我信任的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16898.708, "timestamp": "04:41:38", "text": "很多次，我甚至还把它们带到了直播中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16900.91, "timestamp": "04:41:40", "text": "不过，我倒是想跟你玩游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16904.55, "timestamp": "04:41:44", "text": "当他们出现时，我真的崩溃了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16907.628, "timestamp": "04:41:47", "text": "说了许多关于……的坏话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16912.708, "timestamp": "04:41:52", "text": "我和那些东西，感觉就像我就是这样。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16914.8, "timestamp": "04:41:54", "author": "@Shiori_mitsuki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dn0VbakjSKrSNaXx6PyhznuqbomoCGx22ivSawRcMXp25Io7cfsud3H3qP-g9QprPJUESlxxtJA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Wow i can never "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16915.51, "timestamp": "04:41:55", "text": "我之所以这么做，是因为那件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16919.51, "timestamp": "04:41:59", "text": "两年前我在Twitch上遭遇的创伤。我"}]